# Holds ~230 lines of the original japanese script as dictionary keys.
# It is a local translation table, not something to publish: check_publishable
# refuses it, and name_map.py already reads its sources only 'if they are still
# present in the tree'. Keep your copy; it is not needed to build the patch.
tools/gen_missing3_en.py

